{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_11\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 11</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Variant_of_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Variant of Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CLEVER_MANIPULATIONS!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CLEVER MANIPULATIONS!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_11\">Problem 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After school, Maya and Naomi headed to the beach, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles away. Maya decided to bike while Naomi took a bus. The graph below shows their journeys, indicating the time and distance traveled. What was the difference, in miles per hour, between Naomi's and Maya's average speeds?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/1012d4ebea522bd45aaa55a5d54f98b4db812507.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(1.25cm); dotfactor = 10; pen shortdashed=linetype(new real[] {2.7,2.7});  for (int i = 0; i &lt; 6; ++i) {     for (int j = 0; j &lt; 6; ++j) {         draw((i,0)--(i,6), grey);         draw((0,j)--(6,j), grey);     } }  for (int i = 1; i &lt;= 6; ++i) {     draw((-0.1,i)--(0.1,i),linewidth(1.25));     draw((i,-0.1)--(i,0.1),linewidth(1.25));     label(string(5*i), (i,0), 2*S);     label(string(i), (0, i), 2*W);  }  draw((0,0)--(0,6)--(6,6)--(6,0)--(0,0)--cycle,linewidth(1.25));  label(rotate(90) * &quot;Distance (miles)&quot;, (-0.5,3), W); label(&quot;Time (minutes)&quot;, (3,-0.5), S);  dot(&quot;Naomi&quot;, (2,6), 3*dir(305)); dot((6,6));  label(&quot;Maya&quot;, (4.45,3.5));  draw((0,0)--(1.15,1.3)--(1.55,1.3)--(3.15,3.2)--(3.65,3.2)--(5.2,5.2)--(5.4,5.2)--(6,6),linewidth(1.35)); draw((0,0)--(0.4,0.1)--(1.15,3.7)--(1.6,3.7)--(2,6),linewidth(1.35)+shortdashed); [/asy]\" width=\"425\" height=\"422\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d87dfd17115ce71d5f033cbaa24fc923b031907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }6 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }12 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }18 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }20 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"389\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Naomi travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles in a time of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, which is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c55ed481f94445cc6cf731c6585a80ede1608cdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of an hour. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/916a8955e4a090067862beb104dc54be4163c42f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{speed} = \\frac{\\text{distance}}{\\text{time}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"37\" />, her speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17eb1be0401db2aed5139c6fe10b36e27760d540.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)} = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"72\" height=\"44\" /> mph. By a similar calculation, Maya's speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> mph, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6ac18d4c2d0fb2af3bce5ca7dfec32fd54bddc14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36-12 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"146\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Variant_of_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Variant_of_Solution_1)\">Solution 2 (Variant of Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Variant of Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Naomi's speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/999956907865d13963bffca0c70fb57df8f1f734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 6 = 36$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" /> miles per hour, while Maya's speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes (i.e. half an hour) is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/5/785806dee2edf4f47b6b15f6f4beb572b97b9de3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 2 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> miles per hour. The difference is consequently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/a/cfa9431a3f50477cfc603f7d54230806132ab489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36-12=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"146\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p><p>==Video Solution by Math-X (sofuckingstupidthisguy hes always showing off such a mf. And hes like a 40 year old btw\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UnVo6jZ3Wnk&amp;t=1375s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UnVo6jZ3Wnk&amp;t=1375s</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CLEVER_MANIPULATIONS.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CLEVER_MANIPULATIONS!!!)\">Video Solution (CLEVER MANIPULATIONS!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CLEVER MANIPULATIONS!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gQrRdpw_tu8\">https://youtu.be/gQrRdpw_tu8</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ND0y051eYm0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ND0y051eYm0</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/y__IHWpXprY\">https://youtu.be/y__IHWpXprY</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xjwDsaRE_Wo\">https://youtu.be/xjwDsaRE_Wo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=456\">https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=456</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mGQw1yALXYM&amp;t=1260s\">https://youtu.be/mGQw1yALXYM&amp;t=1260s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8\" title=\"2020 AMC 8\">2020 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problem